    "note": "Version read: Conference Draft 1 (the text both houses took to final reading), not proof of enactment. The bill strikes the old rule that all other firearms be physically inspected at registration, narrowing inspection to listed categories; section 5 repeals section 2 on June 30, 2025. Struck text left out of quotes."
